# Linux provisioning — manual checklist

Generated by chezmoi from `.chezmoidata/packages.toml`. **Do not hand-edit** — change the
`manual = "..."` field on the app in `packages.toml` and re-apply.

`run_onchange_after_install-apps.sh.tmpl` installs everything with an automated Linux route
(distro package → Flathub → upstream tarball). This file lists what is left over: apps in the
curated set that have **no** Linux route, and the post-install steps nobody can automate.

## Apps with no automated Linux route

